{
  "id": "31670_fukikakeru",
  "headword": "{吹|ふ}きかける",
  "reading": "ふきかける",
  "romaji": "fukikakeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to blow on; to spray on",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to blow on; to spray onto",
      "explanation": "To blow breath, or spray a liquid or mist, onto something. The target takes に and the thing blown takes を: {手|て}に{息|いき}を{吹|ふ}きかける."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "31670_fukikakeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかけた。",
      "english": "I blew on my hands.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31670_fukikakeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{植物|しょくぶつ}→植物：03248_shokubutsu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{葉|は}→葉：02241_ha⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかける。",
      "english": "To spray water on a plant's leaves.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31670_fukikakeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{寒|さむ}い→寒い：00664_samui⟧⟦{朝|あさ}→朝：02277_asa⟧、{子|こ}どもたち⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦ガラス→ガラス：01777_garasu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかけて⟦{絵|え}→絵：02613_e⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{描|か}いていた→描く：28436_kaku⟧。",
      "english": "On the cold morning, the children breathed on the window glass and drew pictures.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Also written {吹|ふ}き{掛|か}ける. A second, figurative use is ⟦{喧嘩|けんか}→喧嘩：02996_kenka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかける, to pick a quarrel.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{息|いき}→息：02176_iki⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかける: to breathe on\n- ⟦スプレー→スプレー：11581_supuree⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかける: to spray (with an aerosol)\n- ⟦{霧|きり}→霧：02200_kiri⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかける: to mist (plants, ironing)\n- ⟦{喧嘩|けんか}→喧嘩：02996_kenka⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{吹|ふ}きかける: to pick a fight\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{吹|ふ}く→吹く：02445_fuku⟧: to blow — the basic verb, without a target\n- ⟦{振|ふ}りかける→振りかける：21485_furikakeru⟧: to sprinkle (a powder or seasoning) on",
